    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«ばかりに»: because of (regret)",
     "texto": [
      "To say that a cause, usually a small one, led to a negative result: た form + **ばかり に**: **かさ を わすれた ばかりに、 ぬれて しまいました** (because I forgot my umbrella, I got wet).",
      "It expresses that you regret it."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«ばかりだ»: more and more",
     "texto": [
      "To say something keeps rising or falling: plain-form verb + **ばかり だ**: **ねだん は あがる ばかりだ** (prices keep going up).",
      "It isn't the same as **〜た ばかり** (I've just)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
